WEBVTT

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.700
I love your smell.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:55.650
Christina!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.640
Christina.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:24.510
Christina.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:30.340
Christina!

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:30.930
Nia!

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:56.570
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:14.280
"The Impossible Taboo"

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:17.680
"Closed for the day."

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.560
I hope Nia's okay.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.260
It's her fault for running like that.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.400
She probably couldn't sit still any more...

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.180
...after seeing Ingrid.

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:26.540
Ingrid?

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.620
It's the luck eaters' daughter.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.020
In other words...

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:35.250
...we know Nia's sister must be involved with the demon hunter.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.900
What were you doing there, Tomoharu Natsume?

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:49.520
I was just... uh...

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.200
Now that there's an Asura Cryin' involved...

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.350
...stay out of this matter.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.790
What is an Asura Cryin'?

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.560
It is the impossible taboo...

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.320
...that combines two opposing forces.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.020
It must be eliminated.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:10.690
Why?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.010
You saw the threat that thing poses.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:18.040
Ordinarily, magic power is consumed.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:19.540
But the Asura Cryin'...

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.400
...circulates that power between the daughter and the Asura Machina...

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:26.640
...making it infinitely powerful.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.650
A person with such terrifying power...

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:55.020
...is known as an Asura Cryin'.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:59.110
At this moment, the person closest to that...

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:02.700
...is you, Tomoharu Natsume.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:04.470
What?

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:05.910
Why Tomo?

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:09.190
An Asura Cryin' in a person...

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:12.800
...who possesses both the power of a daughter and an Asura Machina.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.200
A daughter and an Asura Machina?

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.000
It is the reason...

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:21.000
...we tried to kill Takatsuki the day of your entrance ceremony.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:26.600
It was better to eliminate the chance of you becoming an Asura Cryin' sooner rather than later.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:27.760
How could you?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.130
That's awful!

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:31.180
You didn't know if Tomo would become an Asura Cryin'...

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.670
...but you were going to kill her anyway?

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.300
In any case...

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:40.330
...the Asura Cryin' must be eliminated.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:44.870
Any projection body or demon involved must also be eliminated.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:45.650
Silence!

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.630
You fraud!

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.270
It's the handlers that are to blame!

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:50.540
Nia!

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.790
Is it okay for you to be up?

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.940
Don't worry about me.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.000
I'm leaving.

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.980
Wait, Ania Fortuna.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:01.020
You really don't know anything...

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:02.180
...about Christina Fortuna?

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.430
It won't do you any good to hide it.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:06.070
My sister has done no wrong!

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.600
She's being manipulated by humans!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.270
Nia!

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.020
Nia!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.670
I guess she's asleep.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.910
It must be tough for her.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.870
One of her relatives has become a criminal.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.100
How can you say that?

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.880
It's just like Nia said.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:36.560
Maybe her sister is being manipulated by a handler!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:41.170
It's possible as long as we don't know the truth.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.260
Did you know?

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.070
About the Asura Cryin'?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.400
Of course.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.620
Why didn't you tell us?

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.700
I was going to tell you...

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.090
...when the time was right.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.340
What's with that smile?

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.140
Hey, Tomoharu.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.140
It's just a thought...

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.610
...but why don't you go for it?

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:06.000
With Kanade.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.000
What?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.630
But if you became an Asura Cryin' we'll be able to fight back.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:14.190
So why don't you and Kanade...

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.480
Cut it out!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:19.620
You were just thinking dirty thoughts, weren't you, Tomo?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.270
Huh?

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.880
No I wasn't!

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.110
Liar!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.560
Why are you so nervous, then?

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:26.900
Y-you're wrong!

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:31.060
In all seriousness, it's a serious threat.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.550
And now that its identity has been exposed...

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.560
...it's sure to act more aggressively.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.580
It's the humans.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.060
It's the humans' fault my sister...

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.980
"Class 1-7"

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.990
Where did you guys go yesterday?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.920
Everything was ready for Nia's welcome party.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.460
Sorry, An.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.460
I had a lot on my hands.

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.930
Let's have a party today instead!

00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:03.230
Right, Nia?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.360
Did something happen?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:13.540
Hey!

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.010
Did you hear?

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:19.240
There was another vampire incident last night!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.730
What? Again?

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:22.210
Yeah!

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.010
You know that river behind the hospital?

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:28.490
For whatever reason, they've closed it to traffic.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:32.180
It's definitely got something to do with the vampire incidents.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:33.000
It's got to be.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.870
It's just my speculation, though.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:47.000
What do you want?

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.180
Here, take this.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.870
What is that weird thing?

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.870
It's supposed to bring good luck.

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:56.670
A crane, a turtle, and a dragon.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.130
You've got them all.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:03.900
Luck eaters can get luck from this kind of stuff too, right?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.880
Tomo, I know you're trying to be nice...

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.150
...but don't you think that's too much?

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.060
Here...

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.210
I've been using it for a while...

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:18.110
...so I thought it may have absorbed some luck.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:20.740
I don't want them.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:23.470
Just take them.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.010
You look terrible.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.200
Frauds!

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.040
I don't listen to handlers!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:32.760
Natsume!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.540
Saeki?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.240
The Asura Cryin' has appeared!

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.960
It attacked Myorenji High School.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.250
My brother is on his way there...

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.190
...but he can't fight it alone.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.850
What should we do, Tomo?

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:49.180
I don't know.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.100
Nia!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:53.180
Nia.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:55.460
I guess we'll check it out.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:56.590
Please.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.250
Hisui!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.330
Finished?

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.120
Sir!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.690
Mr. President!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.010
"Kadoma Hospital"

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.370
Saeki.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.930
How is your brother?

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:52.040
He'll survive...

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.290
...but he's still unconscious.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:57.470
He'll have to stay hospitalized for a while.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:02.660
The G.D.'s are taking this very seriously.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:04.840
A student that isn't a demon...

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:06.690
...has become a victim.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.790
I'll leave some water here.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:20.580
My sister was always kind like you.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.360
I never thought she would hurt people like that.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:33.220
Maybe she isn't being manipulated by a handler.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.150
Kanade.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.500
Do you like Tomoharu?

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:43.220
So you do.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.880
N-no. That's not it.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:51.420
Then why is my sister helping that handler?

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.380
Could it be for love?

00:12:56.270 --> 00:13:00.330
Demons and handlers are natural enemies.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:04.260
They must be united by emotion, not reason.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:08.180
I'm sure your sister has some kind of reason.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.840
Even if she does, there's no way for me to know.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.710
My sister didn't tell me anything.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.360
Maybe she's changed.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:25.670
It must be because you're both demons.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.700
You smell a lot like my sister.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.270
Hey, Tomo.

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:38.680
Asura Cryin' seem like two-timers.

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:39.770
Huh?

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.170
Think about it.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.290
They have a contract with a burial doll...

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.160
...and a demon.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.530
They're players.

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.330
What are you talking about this time?

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.970
I wonder if that makes you a player, too.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.510
Why me?

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.510
Didn't you hear what Reishiro said?

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:01.860
You're the closest thing to an Asura Cryin'.

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.680
Go to sleep already.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.430
Why don't you?

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:13.780
Listen, Yo.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:17.190
I know who the Asura Cryin' is.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.230
I'm certain.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.350
It must be him.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:28.700
He was there when the Asura Cryin' first appeared.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:34.370
And he was there at Myorenji High School as well.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:35.940
Sir!

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.090
Mr. President!

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:39.930
It must be.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.520
Tomoharu Natsume must be the Asura Cryin'!

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.520
Where is Haruna?

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.840
"Kotori Arayashiki"

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.840
"Whereabouts unknown."

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.060
Student teacher...

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.530
Kotori Arayashiki.

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:59.330
Missing around the same time as Christina?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.210
It's time...

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.140
...for the last stage.

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:29.720
Bye, Tomo.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:30.840
See you tomorrow.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:31.870
Later.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.170
Hey, Tomo.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:34.630
Where's Nia?

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:35.450
Huh?

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:39.140
She just disappeared while I wasn't looking.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:48.940
Has my sister really changed?

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:52.360
What happened to her here?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.360
Nia.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.360
We looked everywhere for you.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.360
Leave me alone.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:15:59.800
Listen.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:02.940
You don't know your way home from here.

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:05.610
Don't mock me!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.790
I memorized it long ago!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.790
What are you so angry about?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.780
If not for you handlers...

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.270
...my sister could have stayed the way she was!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:21.310
My sister is being manipulated by humans...

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.310
...and forced to change!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.120
Come.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.760
What are you doing?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.190
Let go!

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.730
Kanade! Projection body!

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:33.090
Stop him!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.870
Let go of me!

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.120
Let go!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.380
Why are we here?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.480
We're going to look for your sister.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.190
My sister?

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:51.770
What is this?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.270
What are you doing?

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:55.010
This is it!

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.530
"Memories"

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.420
A yearbook?

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.200
Yeah.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.440
Is this her?

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:10.820
Christina.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.200
She looks like a wonderful person.

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:17.450
She's smiling in all of them.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.370
Nothing bad happened to your sister at this school.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.120
She didn't change.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.380
Christina.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.900
I want to see her.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.090
What do we do?

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.250
She's crying.

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.130
Don't ask me.

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:40.290
Nia.

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:41.110
Nia.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.840
Nia, wipe your nose.

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:45.140
Here.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.900
Crying made me thirsty.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:52.820
Huh?

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.940
I said, I'm thirsty.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:56.310
How is that my problem?

00:17:56.580 --> 00:18:00.200
Didn't you tell me to act like a kid?

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:04.740
Sheesh.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:10.650
Why does it always have to be me?

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.160
We meet again, boy.

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:23.660
Have we met?

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:25.230
How could I forget.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.070
It was just yesterday.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:31.850
I see the demon and the projection body aren't with you.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.220
I'm a handler, like you.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:38.920
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:44.210
Look carefully, Reishiro.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:48.340
Is the handler related to the Asura Cryin' in here?

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:52.920
Try to remember everyone that was there at the time.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:58.280
This man.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:03.980
I'm positive.

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.110
This is him.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:07.110
Takaya Kagakagari.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.860
He's the most suspicious of the lot.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:13.340
Who are you?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.830
Before I answer your question...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:16.890
...what do you think?

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:19.210
Why don't you join me?

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.560
I get the feeling you'd understand.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.610
What do you mean?

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:26.080
Can't you tell?

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:29.110
We're very alike, you and I.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.890
You're...!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.830
Depending on your answer...

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:37.280
...I suppose I could overlook the demons of this school.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:44.210
Are you the Asura Cryin'?

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.040
Why are you doing this?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.290
What did you do to Ania's sister?

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.230
So you know about Christina?

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:53.730
Where is she?

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:56.260
What are you trying to do?

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.850
Someday you'll know how I feel.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:01.790
I'm not like you.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.000
I'm disappointed, boy.

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:12.450
Tomo!

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:15.210
Stay here, Nia.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.200
Well, boy?

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.110
Feel like joining me now?

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.000
I refuse!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:24.910
I see.

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:25.930
Ingrid!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.710
Tomoharu!

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:31.770
Tomo!

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:35.840
Engetsu!

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:40.890
Stop, Takatsuki!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.840
I will protect you!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.400
Come, Kurogane!

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:57.590
Kurogane!

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:58.780
Boy.

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.960
We really are the same.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:05.680
Where is my sister?

